OL,3,AUS slaps import ban on Canadian alcohol
OL,4,Aand other goods
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe US is banning Canadian products,
OL,7,Fincluding alcohol, dairy and motor
OL,8,Fvehicles, as Canadian retaliatory
OL,9,Ftariffs on American goods come into
OL,10,Fforce.
OL,12,FIn a series of executive orders on
OL,13,FTuesday, US President Donald Trump
OL,14,Fwrote that Canada is "discriminating"
OL,15,Fagainst the commerce of the United
OL,16,FStates, and ordered the import ban,
OL,17,Fwhich will begin 29 September.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,313,300,200,140,0,100
