OL,3,AUS slaps import ban on Canadian alcohol
OL,4,Aand other goods
OL,5,
OL,6,FEarlier on Tuesday, Canada Prime
OL,7,FMinister Mark Carney said in a video
OL,8,Faddress that his country's pivot away
OL,9,Ffrom the US as its largest trading
OL,10,Fpartner "will come at a cost".
OL,12,FBoth US and Canadian officials have
OL,13,Fsaid they would like to strike a deal,
OL,14,Fbut no new talks have been scheduled
OL,15,Fsince negotiations collapsed in late
OL,16,FAugust.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
